  "question": {
    "text": "A current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is flowing in the sides of an equilateral triangle of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The magnetic field at the centroid of the triangle is"
  },
